results.description:
99x Brazil is on the lookout for skilled Intermediate and Senior Outsystems Developer. As a part of our dynamic team, you will play a vital role in the design, development, and maintenance of applications using the Outsystems platform. You will collaborate with a talented group of developers and designers to deliver high-quality software solutions that meet client requirements.
In this job you will master OutSystems Platform technology in conjunction with modern software engineering practices for developing web and mobile business applications in the context of agile projects.
Responsibilities

Develop solution features following OutSystems development best practices

Work as an IT expert and evangelist while supporting customers in their technical evaluation;

Understand the customers' IT architecture in order to clarify the strategic fit of the OutSystems technology with their IT ecosystem;

Requirements

Advanced English, written and spoken (mandatory).

Bachelor's degree in Computer Science or a related field.

Great communication skills;

Transparency and ability to establish trust and supportive relationships;

Strong quality orientation and attention to detail;

Understanding of solution architecture and design, and web and mobile application performance.

More than 3 years experience, in web and/or mobile application programing;;

BS/BA in computer science or similar

Knowledge of web development or mobile app development, business modeling, database concepts and project management - preferably using Agile Development Methodologies

Deep insight on technical architectures, IT products and product positioning

Proficiency with at least one programming language: PHP, C# or Java;

Proficiency in web based languages: JavaScript, CSS, HTML;

Knowledge in ASP.NET;

Programming with databases: SQL Server, Oracle or MySQL;

Knowledge in Database Modeling;

OutSystems development experience and certifications are a plus;

Degree in Computer Science or Engineering. Academic achievements valued;

Benefits

Your pick when it comes to employment models: CLT/PJ/Cooperativa;

We provide resources for you to grow and learn on the job, including online courses, mentoring, and the latest gen laptops;

A fully remote work environment with flexible working hours;

Bonus for any referrals that we end up hiring;

Originally posted on Himalayas
